   "text": "Bridal Omnichannel Management System.  Overview \u00b7 Platform \u00b7 Inventory \u00b7 Procurement \u00b7 Sales \u00b7 Finance \u2014 desktop and mobile.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Bridal Omnichannel Management System.  Overview \u00b7 Platform \u00b7 Inventory \u00b7 Procurement \u00b7 Sales \u00b7 Finance \u2014 desktop and mobile.",
