   "seed": 875293864,
   "text": "\u00b7  tenants \u00b7 users \u00b7 roles\n\u00b7  branches \u00b7 warehouses\n\u00b7  currencies \u00b7 units \u00b7 terms\n\u00b7  platform_sequences\n\u00b7  exchange rates \u00b7 audit",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
