   "seed": 2050313676,
   "text": "Updates inventory_items and writes a platform_audit_logs row per changed\nfield (old \u2192 new), surfaced on the item's Audit tab (B9).\nsku and barcode are read-only: 41 ledger rows, 6 reservations and 3 purchase\norder lines point at this item, and a printed garment tag is already in the\nshop. Reprint label re-renders the same Code 128 + QR \u2014 it does not reissue.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Updates inventory_items and writes a platform_audit_logs row per changed\nfield (old \u2192 new), surfaced on the item's Audit tab (B9).\nsku and barcode are read-only: 41 ledger rows, 6 reservations and 3 purchase\norder lines point at this item, and a printed garment tag is already in the\nshop. Reprint label re-renders the same Code 128 + QR \u2014 it does not reissue.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "customData": {
    "spec": true
   }
  },
