   "text": "Reads sales_order_items (type=rental) joined to sales_orders and finance_cogs_entries, plus the rent_out / rent_return pairs in inventory_stock_transactions.\nRental COGS (ADR-002) is amortisation, not cost of goods: rental_cogs_per_use = acquisition_cost \u00f7 expected_rental_uses, accumulated into inventory_items.amortised_cost_to_date and CAPPED at acquisition cost.\nThis gown crossed its cap on its 20th rental, so rentals 21\u201324 carried zero COGS and are pure margin \u2014 which is why Payback reads 100% while ROI keeps climbing.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Reads sales_order_items (type=rental) joined to sales_orders and finance_cogs_entries, plus the rent_out / rent_return pairs in inventory_stock_transactions.\nRental COGS (ADR-002) is amortisation, not cost of goods: rental_cogs_per_use = acquisition_cost \u00f7 expected_rental_uses, accumulated into inventory_items.amortised_cost_to_date and CAPPED at acquisition cost.\nThis gown crossed its cap on its 20th rental, so rentals 21\u201324 carried zero COGS and are pure margin \u2014 which is why Payback reads 100% while ROI keeps climbing.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "customData": {
    "spec": true
   }
  },
