  {
   "id": "JfXJr4HXMKlgW2Pgx2vE",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3408,
   "y": 21659.625,
   "width": 1112,
   "height": 75.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#0d9488",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "3Mk6mBxipxLnzUP5tscf"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0",
   "roundness": null,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 604010351,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789469969945,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "seed": 130803386,
   "text": "The key inventory decision for a rental business: which dresses earn their purchase price back, and how fast.\nROI % = rental_revenue_to_date \u00f7 acquisition_cost.   Payback % = amortised_cost_to_date \u00f7 acquisition_cost \u2014 driven by the per-use amortisation in ADR-002:\n   rental_cogs_per_use = acquisition_cost \u00f7 expected_rental_uses   (default 20, overridable per item), accumulated until it reaches acquisition_cost.\nOnce a dress is fully amortised it has paid for itself and further rentals carry ZERO COGS \u2014 which is correct, and is why 'paid back' rows show pure margin from then on.\nIdle rows are capital doing nothing: 17 dresses worth AFN 486,000 have not left the rack in 90 days. Reads inventory_items + sales_order_items + finance_cogs_entries.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The key inventory decision for a rental business: which dresses earn their purchase price back, and how fast.\nROI % = rental_revenue_to_date \u00f7 acquisition_cost.   Payback % = amortised_cost_to_date \u00f7 acquisition_cost \u2014 driven by the per-use amortisation in ADR-002:\n   rental_cogs_per_use = acquisition_cost \u00f7 expected_rental_uses   (default 20, overridable per item), accumulated until it reaches acquisition_cost.\nOnce a dress is fully amortised it has paid for itself and further rentals carry ZERO COGS \u2014 which is correct, and is why 'paid back' rows show pure margin from then on.\nIdle rows are capital doing nothing: 17 dresses worth AFN 486,000 have not left the rack in 90 days. Reads inventory_items + sales_order_items + finance_cogs_entries.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "customData": {
    "spec": true
   }
  },
