   "text": "This does not delete anything.\n\nA new reversing row FIN26-000438 will be created for \u221222,000 AFN,\nlinked by reverses_id. FIN26-000437 will be marked 'void'.\nBoth rows stay in the ledger permanently.\n\nEffects: Cash Drawer \u221222,000 \u00b7 Income \u221222,000 \u00b7 A/R for\nSO26-000011 reopened at 22,000 \u00b7 the sale's COGS entry reversed.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "This does not delete anything.\n\nA new reversing row FIN26-000438 will be created for \u221222,000 AFN,\nlinked by reverses_id. FIN26-000437 will be marked 'void'.\nBoth rows stay in the ledger permanently.\n\nEffects: Cash Drawer \u221222,000 \u00b7 Income \u221222,000 \u00b7 A/R for\nSO26-000011 reopened at 22,000 \u00b7 the sale's COGS entry reversed.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
